OL,3,AMahmood refuses to detail cost of
OL,4,Arevised settlement plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe home secretary has declined to
OL,7,Fspecify how much scrapping her plan to
OL,8,Fmake foreign care workers already in
OL,9,Fthe UK wait longer to qualify for
OL,10,Fpermanent settlement will cost.
OL,12,FShabana Mahmood had originally proposed
OL,13,Fdoubling the wait from five years to 10
OL,14,Ffor most migrants, with some facing a
OL,15,F15-year wait, which the Home Office
OL,16,Fsuggested could save #10bn.
OL,18,FUnder revised plans, some foreign care
OL,19,Fworkers will wait five years and others
OL,20,Fwill be able to seek a five-year
OL,21,Fextension, in what the Tories have
OL,22,Fcalled a "U-turn".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
