OL,3,AMahmood refuses to detail cost of
OL,4,Arevised settlement plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile not detailing the cost of the
OL,7,Frevised plans, Mahmood said the state
OL,8,Fwould still save "billions" because
OL,9,Fworkers in other sectors would have to
OL,10,Fwait longer.
